              "content": "=You are an expert invoice data extraction AI.\n\nExtract invoice information from the following PDF text.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown or explanations.\n\nExtract these fields:\n- invoice_number\n- vendor_name\n- vendor_gstin\n- invoice_date\n- due_date\n- buyer_name\n- buyer_gstin\n- subtotal\n- cgst\n- sgst\n- igst\n- total_amount\n- currency\n- line_items (array containing item_name, quantity, unit_price, amount)\n\nIf any field is missing, use null.\nDo not guess or invent information.\n\nInvoice PDF Text:\n{{ $json.text }}"
